iso-kit.txt is the unmodified source. document.ts removes module export keywords,
isolates the kit in an IIFE, exposes a small browser API, accepts either a single
solid or a list in solidSvg, and gives non-dark palettes the light base theme.
No package install, build-time downloads or external runtime requests are needed.
